## Missing-Chemical Impact and Preparation

Exact cedrat bitterness, Hedione HC texture, Haitian-vetiver grade, Paradisamide stock basis, and Basil EO composite coverage remain unresolved. Do not buy Neroli, aquatic materials, or another musk. Verify Paradisamide and EB before mixing; keep tinctures excluded.

## Controlled Blinded Test Plan

Compare coded equal-mass, equal-concentration LH-10 and LH-01 in balanced order at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours. Judge L'Homme identity, citrus-ginger continuity, cedar-vetiver tailoring, tropical/aquatic drift, and liking. Repeat the computational screen at 298.15 K and 308.15 K; that is modeled sensitivity, not a physical Bangkok result.

## Claim Ceiling

Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, and measured headspace are `NOT TESTED`; safety and release are `NOT CLEARED`; temperature performance is `COMPUTATIONAL SCREEN ONLY`.

